SUMMARY:Roz Chast & Jason Adam Katzenstein
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:“I don’t think I’ve ever laughed so hard. Everyone not na
 med Martha Stewart will recognize themselves in The Two Saddest Kitchens
 ” — Ruth Reichl Two hilarious\, celebrated cartoonists visit MASS MoCA
  to discuss a highly relatable subject — kitchen anxiety: Roz Chast and 
 Jason Adam Katzenstein are both longtime New Yorker cartoonists with their
  own unique drawing styles\, huge followings\,and legions of loyal fans. C
 hast’s Can’t We Talk About Something More Pleasant? spent over a hundr
 ed weeks on the NYT bestseller list and sold more than 150\,000 hardcovers
 \; Katzenstein’s fan base pulls from his magazine work as well as TV and
  graphic novels.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/roz-chast-jason-adam-katzenst
 ein/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/roz-chast-jason-adam-katzenstein/
END:VEVENT
